# Session 11 Assignments – HTML & CSS Frontend Development

##  Overview
This session focuses on **frontend web development fundamentals** using **HTML5** and **CSS3**.  
The assignments cover webpage structure, layout creation, list design, header/footer sections, reusable styles, and working with assets like images and resource folders.

This session builds the foundation for responsive web UI development.

---

##  Topics Covered
- HTML5 Fundamentals
- CSS3 Styling
- Webpage Structure
- Semantic HTML
- Ordered / Unordered Lists
- Header & Footer Layout
- Resource Organization
- Styling Architecture
- Asset Management

---

